---
module: backend
func_id: alert-api
---

***conformance tests***

# list-alerts
`GET /api/alerts?status=all` answers 200 with a list, and each alert in it has a `patientName`, a `severity` of red, yellow or grey and a `status` of new, acknowledged or closed.

***acceptance tests***

# unknown-alert
`POST /api/alerts/999999/ack` with clinicianId "c1" answers 404.
